sequenceDiagram
    participant Ex as Existing Cluster
    participant New as New Node
    participant CLI as redis-cli

    CLI->>Ex: CLUSTER MEET 127.0.0.1 7006
    Ex->>New: Handshake
    New->>Ex: Join Cluster

    CLI->>Ex: CLUSTER SLOTS (checking)
    Ex->>CLI: Slot distribution

    CLI->>Ex: Request slot migration
    Ex->>New: Migrate keys for slots

    Note over Ex,New: For a replica node
    CLI->>New: CLUSTER REPLICATE [master-id]